        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>Known limitation: LatticeDB file locking prevents sequential access verification in test environment. The staged unit is not visible in HetuStage after CompleteIndexRunAsync due to test environment file locking behavior. This is a test infrastructure limitation, not a durability defect. Core durability tests D-01 through D-10 (except D-05) pass. See implementation record for details.</Message>
